# EAS Build project archive excludes. When this file exists, EAS uses ONLY
# these rules (does not merge with .gitignore) — so this must cover
# everything, not just what git already ignores.
#
# Lives at the REPO ROOT, not inside apps/mobile: this repo isn't an npm/yarn
# workspace, but apps/mobile isn't the git root either, so EAS still treats
# it as a monorepo and archives from here. A .easignore placed inside
# apps/mobile is silently ignored — it must be here for any rule to apply.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.metro-health-check*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
*.pem
.env
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# Native build output (both the legacy Capacitor app's own android/ios at
# the repo root, AND apps/mobile's expo-prebuild-generated android/ios) —
# regenerated by prebuild, must never be uploaded. Windows file locks on
# native .so/.o intermediates crash the EAS tarball compression step.
android/
ios/
